@final_project_API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7051/api

### Register
POST {{final_project_API_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Driver",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "licensePlate": "12-345-67"
}

### Login
POST {{final_project_API_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### List stations (needs a token from login/register above)
GET {{final_project_API_HostAddress}}/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List spots, paginated
GET {{final_project_API_HostAddress}}/spots?stationId=1&page=1&pageSize=6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a session on a spot (the limited resource) - try this twice quickly with two spots to see a 409
POST {{final_project_API_HostAddress}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "spotId": 1
}

### End a session
PATCH {{final_project_API_HostAddress}}/sessions/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "energyDeliveredKwh": 12.5
}
